"A language model on this Mac reads the text before the cursor. It moves the candidate that reads best to the front (marked ✦), and after you enter a word it shows what likely comes next; Tab takes it. Nothing you type leaves this Mac. Automatic uses Qwen3-1.7B, and a smaller model on a Mac too slow for it. Any MLX model in the models folder can be chosen." = "在這台 Mac 上執行的語言模型會讀取游標前的文字：把最通順的候選字排到第一個（標示 ✦），輸入後以灰字列出接下來可能的字，按 Tab 輸入。你輸入的文字不會離開這台 Mac。自動：使用 Qwen3-1.7B，這台 Mac 跑不動時改用較小的模型。模型資料夾裡的 MLX 模型都可以選。";
